tyle="--i:2">black.</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:3">The</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:4">rest</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:5">is</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:6">up</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:7">to</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:8">you.</span></span></span></h2></div><div class="mt-6 max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-espresso/75 sm:text-lg"><p data-reveal="fade-up" style="--reveal-delay:200ms">We started with one stubborn idea: a perfect black espresso is the foundation of every great iced latte. So we roast two single origin coffees in small batches and pull every shot to order.</p><p data-reveal="fade-up" style="--reveal-delay:320ms">Then we make our flavors the slow way, every morning, from real caramel, real vanilla bean, toasted hazelnuts and dark chocolate. Pick one above, or keep it classic. Either way, it starts black.</p></div><dl class="mt-10 grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-espresso/15 pt-8"><div data-reveal="fade-up" style="--reveal-delay:0ms" class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-2"><dt class="text-xs leading-snug text-espresso/65 sm:text-sm">Single origins, roasted every week</dt><dd class="font-heading font-soft text-4xl font-medium leading-none tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-5xl">2</dd></div><div data-reveal="fade-up" style="--reveal-delay:120ms" class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-2"><dt class="text-xs leading-snug text-espresso/65 sm:text-sm">Flavors made in house each morning</dt><dd class="font-heading font-soft text-4xl font-medium leading-none tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-5xl">6</dd></div><div data-reveal="fade-up" style="--reveal-delay:240ms" class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-2"><dt class="text-xs leading-snug text-espresso/65 sm:text-sm">Powders or artificial syrups</dt><dd class="font-heading font-soft text-4xl font-medium leading-none tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-5xl">0</dd></div></dl></div></div></section>
